<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@400;700&family=Shippori+Mincho:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        /* 芹菜用テーマカラー：プロフェッショナルな深いマゼンタと清潔な白 */
        body { font-family: "Shippori Mincho", "Zen Kaku Gothic New", serif; margin: 0; background-color: #fdfdfd; color: #333; line-height: 1.8; }
        header { text-align: center; padding: 20px; background: #fff; border-bottom: 4px solid #ad1457; position: relative; }
        .back-home { position: absolute; left: 20px; top: 30px; text-decoration: none; color: #ad1457; font-weight: bold; font-family: sans-serif; }
        .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
        
        /* ヒーローエリアの強化 */
        .hero-section {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0f5 0%, #ffffff 100%);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        h1 { 
            font-size: 2.8rem; 
            color: #ad1457; 
            margin-bottom: 10px; 
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .sub-h1 { 
            font-size: 1.2rem; 
            color: #555; 
            margin-bottom: 30px; 
            font-family: sans-serif; 
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .catch-copy {
            background-color: #ad1457;
            color: #fff;
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 30px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            transform: skew(-10deg); /* 勢いをつける */
            box-shadow: 5px 5px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .catch-copy span {
            display: inline-block;
            transform: skew(10deg); /* 文字の傾きを戻す */
        }

        h2 { text-align: center; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-top: 70px; margin-bottom: 40px; color: #880e4f; border-bottom: 2px solid #f8bbd0; padding-bottom: 15px; display: inline-block; width: 100%; }
        
        /* プロフィール */
        .profile-box { background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; gap: 30px; align-items: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-left: 6px solid #ad1457; }
        .skill-tags span { background: #fce4ec; color: #880e4f; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-right: 5px; display: inline-block; font-family: sans-serif; font-weight: bold; }

        /* 実績カード */
        .achievement-card { background: #fff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); margin-bottom: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #ad1457; }

        /* --- 最強プラン（ドル箱）エリア --- */
        .special-plan-area {
            background-color: #fff0f5;
            border: 2px solid #ad1457;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(173, 20, 87, 0.15);
        }
        .best-badge {
            position: absolute;
            top: -20px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            background: #ffd700;
            color: #d35400;
            padding: 10px 40px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            border: 2px solid #fff;
        }
        .plan-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #ad1457;
            margin-top: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .plan-desc {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #444;
        }
        .plan-details {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .plan-item {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 15px 25px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #f8bbd0;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #880e4f;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .plan-item::before {
            content: "✔";
            margin-right: 10px;
            color: #ad1457;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
        .plan-target {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* 料金表エリア（通常） */
        .price-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .price-card {
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #fce4ec;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
            transition: 0.3s;
            cursor: pointer;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .price-card:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(216, 27, 96, 0.1);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            border-color: #f8bbd0;
            background-color: #fff0f5;
        }
        .price-title {
            color: #d81b60;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #fce4ec;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: baseline;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .price-note { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #888; font-weight: normal; }
        .price-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 0.95rem; font-family: "Zen Kaku Gothic New", sans-serif; }
        .client-type { color: #666; background: #f8f9fa; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; }
        .client-type.biz { background: #fff0f5; color: #ad1457; }
        .price-val { font-weight: bold; color: #333; }
        .click-hint { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #d81b60; text-align: right; margin-top: 10px; font-weight: bold; font-family: sans-serif; }

        /* ギャラリー共通 */
        .gallery-grid { display: grid; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .g-img { width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; border: 1px solid #eee; }
        .g-img:hover { transform: scale(1.02); box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .col-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(400px, 1fr)); }
        .col-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr)); }
        
        .contact-btn-main {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ad1457, #d81b60);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 15px 60px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(173, 20, 87, 0.3);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .contact-btn-main:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(173, 20, 87, 0.4);
        }

        /* モーダル */
        .modal { display: none; position: fixed; z-index: 999; left: 0; top: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.9); justify-content: center; align-items: center; }
        .modal-content { max-width: 90%; max-height: 90vh; }
        .close { position: absolute; top: 20px; right: 30px; color: #fff; font-size: 40px; cursor: pointer; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <a href="/portfolio" class="back-home">← Back to Portal</a>
        <h1>TOMOKA SERINA PORTFOLIO</h1>
        <!-- 肩書き変更 -->
        <div class="sub-h1">Game UI Designer / Illustrator / Implementation Specialist</div>
    </header>

    <div class="hero-section">
        <div class="catch-copy">
            <span>実装に強いUI、作れます</span>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:bold;">
            ゲームエンジン（Unity/Unreal/ツクール等）の仕様を熟知したUIデザイン。<br>
            「絵が描ける」だけでなく、「動く画面」を設計する専門家です。
